              <ul style="line-height:1.8;padding-left:20px;margin:20px 0;"><li style="margin-bottom:10px;"><strong>Paid-ads buyers (2):</strong> day-to-day Google Ads and Meta Ads campaign management</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;"><strong>SEO writers (3):</strong> long-form content production, on-page optimization</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;"><strong>Social media managers (2):</strong> content calendars, daily posting, community management</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;"><strong>Designers (2):</strong> ad creative, landing-page design, brand assets</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;"><strong>Videographer (1):</strong> Reels, TikTok, ad creative, UGC editing</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;"><strong>Analytics specialist (1):</strong> tracking implementation, dashboards, reporting</li></ul>
