              <h2 class="cs-font_36 mb-4">Cross-team with Apex IT Solutions</h2>
              <p>Many marketing engagements need technical work too — landing pages, custom analytics, website rebuilds, marketing automation backends. For those, we collaborate with our sister company <a href="https://www.apexitsolutions.co/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apex IT Solutions</a>, which handles software engineering, DevOps, custom development, and 3D production. The two firms share leadership and engineering DNA but specialize separately so that each delivers expert work in its lane.</p>
            <h2 class="cs-font_36 mb-4 mt-5">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
              <h3 class="cs-font_24 mt-4 mb-2">Can I meet the team before signing?</h3><p>Yes. During Discovery you'll meet at least 2 of the named specialists who'd work on your account. We don't do 'sales-only' calls; the people who'd run your campaigns are present from the first technical conversation.</p>
              <h3 class="cs-font_24 mt-4 mb-2">How many people will be on my account?</h3><p>Standard team: 1 senior strategist (account owner), 1-2 specialists (paid / SEO / social, depending on services), 1 designer/creative producer (part-time on retainer).</p>
              <h3 class="cs-font_24 mt-4 mb-2">Is the team in-house or freelance?</h3><p>100% in-house, salaried employees. We don't subcontract client work. This is why our retention is high and our quality is consistent.</p>
              <h3 class="cs-font_24 mt-4 mb-2">Where is the team based?</h3><p>Headquarters in Rawalpindi, Pakistan. Some specialists work hybrid (Rawalpindi/Islamabad/Lahore). We don't have offshore offices in lower-cost regions — all delivery happens in-house.</p>
